# No formatter is configured in this repo (see CLAUDE.md). This file exists so
# that IF Prettier is ever introduced — or if a contributor has the editor
# extension running with format-on-save — it cannot reformat index.html.
#
# Why index.html specifically: Naver's ADVoost diagnostic parses HTML line by
# line. Prettier's printWidth would wrap the long <meta> tags onto multiple
# lines, and a tag whose content="" sits on a different line from its name=""
# reads to that parser as absent — silently dropping the site's SEO grade to C
# with no visible breakage. The tags must stay on one line each.
#
# Leading slash anchors this to the repo root — tools/banner-generator/index.html
# is a local dev tool and is fine to format.
/index.html

# Generated: minified/derived output, not hand-edited source.
dist/
